Package: fpmrs.bibliometrics
Title: Longitudinal Bibliometric Analysis of URPS Literature
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tyler", "Muffly", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tyler.muffly@dhha.org")
Description: Manuscript-ready longitudinal bibliometric analysis of
    Urogynecology and Reconstructive Pelvic Surgery (URPS) literature,
    with PubMed retrieval, OpenAlex enrichment, and comparative
    subspecialty benchmarking. This DESCRIPTION exists to declare the
    dependency surface for reproducible installs and CI; the project is
    consumed by sourcing R/fpmrs_bibliometrics_pipeline.R rather than by
    library() attachment.
